### create customer
POST http://localhost:3000/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId":"cust-1", "businessId":"biz-1", "name":"ACME", "email":"ops@acme.test" }

### create invoice
POST http://localhost:3000/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{ "invoiceId":"inv-1", "businessId":"biz-1", "customerId":"cust-1", "amountCents":42000, "currency":"EUR", "dueDate":"2026-05-10" }

### issue invoice
POST http://localhost:3000/invoices/issue
Content-Type: application/json

{ "invoiceId":"inv-1" }

### register payment
POST http://localhost:3000/invoices/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "invoiceId":"inv-1", "paymentId":"pay-1", "amountCents":42000, "idempotencyKey":"idem-payment-1" }

### wallet flow
POST http://localhost:3000/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "walletId":"w-1", "businessId":"biz-1", "currency":"EUR" }
